+### 6.5 `getPlayerEaAttributes` as implemented in Step 4.6
+- `GET /api/v1/players/{player_id}/ea-attributes`; same id grammar and error model as `getPlayer` (400 `INVALID_PLAYER_ID` with `instance` null, 404 only for a well-formed unknown id, 503 first when the service is unavailable). The contract marks it `IMPLEMENTABLE_TODAY`; its `EaDetailedAttributes` block is `PLANNED`.
